{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ブログ読んでるよ！」\n「ブログおもしろいね！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…更新するしかぁぁぁあああ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お世辞という言葉を知らない\n単純な中田です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで\n今日はモーターショー来て下さったかた\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつかなりん☆←\nイベントは\n楽しんでいただけましたか？＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／幕張干した＼\n高ま…\n高山ってぁぁぁあああ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／幕張とはしご＼\nうーんと…\nけっこう高山った！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いま中田ブログ読んでくれてるとか\n高山った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝早くから並んでくださった方々も\n握手は間に合わなかったけど来て下さった方々も\n寒い中\n本当にありがとうございました(*^^*)\n来れなかった方々は\nまた会いましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのう月見た？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n立て込んでて\n見れてないんです(´;ω;｀)\n見たかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長文コメ迷惑じゃない？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nぜんぜん！\nむしろありがたいです！(´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"睡眠時間は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n電車だとか昼間だとか\nちょくちょく寝てるので\n合計何時間寝てるか\nわかんないんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/shock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←\n今日も朝にoversleepしました(・ω・)\nはい、ちょっとかっこつけて\n言ってみました｀・ω・´キラッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/11/111211_1551010001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃはかなり最初の方から\n仲良くしてるのよ～＼^^／\nコンベンションでも\n一緒に踊った仲間だしね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！\nこんな感じの写メが欲しいとかあったら\nぜひぜひ教えてください☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃ！\n最近飛鳥の小さすぎる顔を\n片手でつかむのにはまっている\n中田でした(¨)ノガシッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※中田の手が大きいのではありません！\n飛鳥の顔が小さすぎるのです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}